===Etymology===
From {{etyl|fr}} {{term|terrasse|lang=fr}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈtɛɹəs/}}, {{X-SAMPA|/"tEr@s/}}
* {{rhymes|ɛrəs}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A [[platform]] that extends outwards from a [[building]].
# A [[raised]], [[flat]]-[[topped]] [[bank]] of [[earth]] with [[sloping]] [[side]]s, especially one of a [[series]] for [[farming]] or [[leisure]]; a similar [[natural]] area of [[ground]], often next to a [[river]].
# A [[row]] of [[residential]] [[house]]s with no [[gap]]s between them; a group of [[row house]]s.
# {{in the plural|chiefly|British}} The [[standing]] [[area]] at a [[football]] [[ground]].

